ent-SWGlobalWarPlanetTeleporter = planetary teleporter
    .desc = Transfers personnel between a planet's surface and orbital station. Activate it to travel.
sw-global-war-teleporter-denied = Get closer, leave your container or unbuckle before using the teleporter.
sw-global-war-teleporter-unlinked = The teleporter has no unique endpoint on the opposite side of this planet.
sw-global-war-teleporter-to-surface = Linked to the surface of this planet. Activate it to travel.
sw-global-war-teleporter-to-orbit = Linked to the orbital station of this planet. Activate it to travel.
sw-global-war-teleporter-blocked = The destination is occupied. Clear the landing area before trying again.
sw-global-war-teleporter-linked-load = This transfer only lets you tow a cargo crate or container with nobody inside. It does not move people or other towing groups.
